      "content": "hey, i'm having one of those crazy migraines again. it hit me super fast, like in like 5 seconds it just went from zero to the worst pain ive ever felt. it's kinda nauseous too. i already have my sumatriptan pills, should i just take a couple to get ahead of it or is that too much?",
