    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check with a doctor but i cant really afford an urgent care visit right now if it's just a migraine. it's just way more intense than my usual ones lol. like i've never felt anything this bad before. if i take one now and it doesn't work in an hour, is it safe to take another one? i just need the pain to stop so i can sleep.",
