      "content": "Since this is unlike your usual migraines, please treat this as a serious medical event and try to reach a nurse advice line or telehealth service if an in-person visit is not possible. Generally, you should wait the full recommended dosage interval before taking a second dose of sumatriptan, even if the first dose doesn't work. Do not take a second dose before checking with a medical professional to confirm safety, especially with an unusually severe headache.",
